  architecture: "B+ (two-doc): covenant.vsm §identity (public, witnessed) + covenant_ops.vsm §regulation (internal, gated)"
  ai_consensus: "Claude proposed B+ (SYN-COV-01/02); Qwen conceded D→B+ + cross-doc mechanics (RES-COV-02)"
