  weakens_identity: "NO — constrains synthetic injection strictly; default remains prohibition"
  ai_drafter:   "Claude (Fable 5) — session 2026-07-02, from the CASE-TRIAGE-CONFAB postmortem"
  decision:     "S5 RATIFIED in-session 2026-07-02 — rmw3: 'firmemos esto AUTOIMMUNE-TEST'"
